---
description: Stories and Code Connect files follow the component catalog contract
globs: Code/**/*.stories.*, Code/**/*.figma.*, Code/figma.config.json, Code/.storybook/**
alwaysApply: false
---

Auto-attaches when editing stories, Code Connect files, or their config.

- Each story or mapping matches its component's row and property mapping in
  `Docs/Design system/Guidelines/components.md`.
- Stories add no styles of their own; the workbench never ships with the build.
- Never invent a Figma node link. Never publish Code Connect from CI or an agent session.

Full guidance: `Agents/context/component-catalog.md`.
